\text{Lateral Surface Area} = \frac{1}{2} \times 10 \times (10 + 8) = \frac{1}{2} \times 10 \times 18 = 90 \text{ square centimeters}
\] \[
\text{Area of Base 1} = \pi \times 10^2 = 100\pi \text{ square centimeters}
\] \[
\text{Area of Base 2} = \pi \times 8^2 = 64\pi \text{ square centimeters}
\] \[
\text{Total Surface Area} = 90 + 100\pi + 64\pi = 90 + 164\pi \text{ square centimeters}
